OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%,.** %-,(,%,. (,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AChancellor rejects calls to raise
OL,4,ACapital Gains Tax in Budget, sources
OL,5,Asay
OL,6,
OL,7,FAhead of next week's Budget, as first
OL,8,Freported by the Times, Healey is minded
OL,9,Fnot to increase CGT - which is imposed
OL,10,Fon the profit people make when they
OL,11,Fsell an asset that has increased in
OL,12,Fvalue, such as shares in a company or
OL,13,Fproperties which are not primary
OL,14,Fresidences.
OL,16,FThe move followed warnings that it
OL,17,Fcould end up costing the government
OL,18,Fmoney if wealthy people leave the
OL,19,Fcountry or defer selling off assets.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
